guide polestar-completionist-horde/raid-molten-core
title Molten Core (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 60-60
zone Searing Gorge
pitch Molten Core, in Searing Gorge. A raid.
why Every Horde quest of Molten Core: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
  note The entrance is in Searing Gorge: the arrow leads to it. This is a raid: it needs a raid group.

step Examine the Vessel
  tip This quest starts from an item: use it to take the quest.
  collect 19016 x1 anywhere
  accept 7785 item 19016

